{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>And the descendants of Reuben.</b> The tribes are counted here one after another in the order of the standards, beginning with Reuben the firstborn, then after him Judah the leader, then after him Ephraim and Dan." "<b>Reuben, firstborn of Israel.</b> Since in the standard-camp order Judah was first, it now gives a reason — because he was the firstborn, He counts him first."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:16:08.699196826Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}